  "content": "<div class=\"mwstitle section\">\n\n    <h1 property=\"name\" id=\"wb-cont\" dir=\"ltr\">\nCulture, history and sport</h1>\n\t</div>\n<div class=\"mwscolumns section\">\n    \n\n    \n\n        \n\n        \n            \n        <div class=\"row \">\n            \n                <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n    <p>Learn about Canada's culture, identity, history and sports, as well as funding opportunities available to Canadian  artists, athletes and organizations. Discover our national landmarks and attractions and show your pride for Canada by taking part in the many cultural events, celebrations and commemorations.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"mwscarousel section\">\n\n\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"wb-tabs carousel-s2 playing slow wb-init wb-tabs-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-4\">\n\t<ul role=\"tablist\" aria-live=\"off\"><li class=\"control prv\"><a class=\"prv\" role=\"button\" title=\"Previous\" href=\"javascript:;\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-chevron-left\"></span><span class=\"wb-inv\">Previous</span></a></li> <li class=\"control  tab-count\" tabindex=\"0\"><div>Item <div class=\"curr-count\"><span class=\"curr-index\">1</span> of 2</div></div></li><li class=\"control nxt\"><a class=\"nxt\" role=\"button\" title=\"Next\" href=\"javascript:;\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-chevron-right\"></span><span class=\"wb-inv\">Next</span></a></li> \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"active\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"#tab1-mwscarousel\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"tab1-mwscarousel\" id=\"tab1-mwscarousel-lnk\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"img-responsive\" src=\"/content/dam/themes/culture/carousel/asian-heritage-month-2026-653x194.jpg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"wb-inv\">Tab\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1:Celebrate Asian Herita